  "remarks": "TAi.113 Title: Maulavi. Designation: Deputy of High Court under the Taliban regime. Deputy Head of Taliban Embassy in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia until 25 Sept. 1998. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 27 Jul. 2010. Picture available for inclusion in the INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice. Afghan passport number OA296623; Listing: Listed on 23 February 2001 (amended on 18 Jul 2007, 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov. 2011 and 22 April 2013, 7 Sep. 2016)",
